  GUZMAN Y GOMEZ: Eating Out
  DOMINOS PIZZA: Eating Out
  NANDOS: Eating Out
  OPORTO: Eating Out
  ZAMBRERO: Eating Out

  # --- Transport ---
  TRANSPORTFORNSW OPAL: Public Transport
