  # --- Health ---
  CHEMIST WAREHOUSE: Health
  PRICELINE PHARMACY: Health
  CITY PHYSIO CLINIC: Health
  SMILE DENTAL: Health
  MEDICAL CENTRE: Health
  ANYTIME FITNESS: Fitness
  LOCAL GYM: Fitness

  # --- Shopping ---
  BUNNINGS WAREHOUSE: Shopping
  IKEA: Shopping
  JB HI FI: Shopping
  REBEL SPORT: Shopping
  KMART: Shopping
